# Cloudflare Pages: headers for the static app, matching frontend/nginx.conf (DECISIONS.md, D-033).
# API responses come from the backend through functions/, which sets its own headers.
/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: no-referrer
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; img-src 'self' blob:; frame-ancestors 'none'; base-uri 'self'; form-action 'self'
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000
